Package: uqcca
Title: Uncertainty Quantification for Sparse Canonical Correlation
        Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Claire", "Donnat", , "cdonnat@uchicago.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits sparse canonical correlation models through the external
    ccar3 implementation and provides bootstrap- and cross-fitting-based
    uncertainty quantification utilities. The package also includes
    simulation helpers for benchmarking coverage, false discovery, and
    subspace recovery in reduced-rank regression settings.
